Package: CDALabeller
Title: Label Cell Death Areas in Agroinfiltration Images
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Joshua", "Williams", , "joshuandwilliams@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A 'shiny' app for annotating cell death areas (CDAs) in
    agroinfiltration source images. Users draw a square bounding box around
    each CDA and record its treatment. They also give it a cell death severity
    score from 0 to 6. The annotations are exported as a CSV file that
    'AutoCDAScorer' reads. Each row also records when the bounding box was
    drawn, the source image's MD5 checksum and the app version.
URL: https://github.com/joshuandwilliams/CDALabeller
BugReports: https://github.com/joshuandwilliams/CDALabeller/issues
